 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. A,F,B are collinear [01] & A,G,C are collinear [03] & EG ⟂ AC [04] & EF ⟂ AB [02] ⇒  ∠EFA = ∠EGA [06]
002. ∠EFA = ∠EGA [06] ⇒  A,E,G,F are concyclic [07]
003. A,E,G,F are concyclic [07] ⇒  ∠AEG = ∠AFG [08]
004. A,G,C are collinear [03] & ∠CAH = ∠DAB [05] & ∠AEG = ∠AFG [08] & A,E,D are collinear [00] & F,A,B are collinear [01] ⇒  ∠EGF = ∠GAH [09]
005. A,G,C are collinear [03] & AC ⟂ EG [04] ⇒  AG ⟂ EG [10]
006. ∠EGF = ∠GAH [09] & AG ⟂ EG [10] ⇒  AH ⟂ FG
